sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Istio Ingress Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.3
    participant KRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS mTLS
    participant VLLMhttp as vLLM HTTP API<br/>8000/TCP HTTP plaintext
    participant GPU as AMD ROCm GPU<br/>PCIe/Infinity Fabric

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Client,GPU: Flow 1: LLM Inference Request (HTTP - OpenAI-compatible)
        Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (JWT)
        Gateway->>KRBAC: Forward request<br/>mTLS (Istio service identity)
        KRBAC->>KRBAC: Validate AuthN/AuthZ
        KRBAC->>VLLMhttp: HTTP/8000<br/>plaintext (localhost)
        VLLMhttp->>GPU: Tensor operations<br/>PCIe/Infinity Fabric
        GPU-->>VLLMhttp: Inference result
        VLLMhttp-->>KRBAC: JSON Response
        KRBAC-->>Gateway: HTTPS Response
        Gateway-->>Client: JSON Response<br/>TLS 1.3
    end

    participant Caikit as Caikit / gRPC Client
    participant IstioSC as Istio Sidecar<br/>mTLS
    participant TGIS as vLLM TGIS Adapter<br/>8033/TCP gRPC
    participant VLLMeng as vLLM Engine<br/>(in-process)

    rect rgb(245, 255, 245)
        Note over Caikit,VLLMeng: Flow 2: LLM Inference Request (gRPC/TGIS)
        Caikit->>IstioSC: gRPC/8033<br/>mTLS (Istio)
        IstioSC->>TGIS: gRPC/8033<br/>plaintext (localhost)
        TGIS->>VLLMeng: In-process call
        VLLMeng->>GPU: Tensor operations
        GPU-->>VLLMeng: Inference result
        VLLMeng-->>TGIS: Generation response
        TGIS-->>IstioSC: gRPC response
        IstioSC-->>Caikit: gRPC response<br/>mTLS
    end

    participant VLLM as vLLM Container
    participant Storage as Model Storage<br/>(S3/HF Hub)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over VLLM,GPU: Flow 3: Model Loading (startup)
        VLLM->>Storage: Download model weights<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: IAM/HMAC/Bearer
        Storage-->>VLLM: Model artifacts
        VLLM->>GPU: Load to GPU memory<br/>PCIe/Infinity Fabric
    end
